Examples: \fBmethod in ["GET", "HEAD"] and hour >= 22 or hour < 6\fR (read\-only traffic in the night window), \fBcountry in ["SE", "NO", "DK"] && not has_cookie("consent")\fR, \fBpath matches "^/api/v[0\-9]+/" && header("Content\-Length") > 1048576\fR, \fBcapture("id") != "" && ja4 == ""\fR.
