T}
.TE
.SS "logging.journald"
.PP
Native journald protocol over the journal\(aqs datagram socket, no cgo. The JSON line is \fBMESSAGE\fR; the level maps to \fBPRIORITY\fR; the stream and every top\-level attribute become \fBXPROXY_*\fR fields, so \fBjournalctl XPROXY_CLIENT_IP=203.0.113.9\fR works without parsing.
.PP
.TS
