.SS "upstreams[].retry_budget"
.PP
A retry (or a hedged copy) is only sent while the retries in flight to the pool stay below \fBpercent\fR of the requests in flight, with \fBmin_concurrency\fR always allowed so a low\-traffic pool can still retry. As live traffic falls the allowance falls with it, so retries cannot amplify an outage.
