What happens to a client whose challenge cookie carries automation markers (\fBInfo.\:Automation\fR: WebDriver,\: driver globals,\: chromedriver,\: a headless user agent,\: no languages,\: no plugins,\: a zero sized window);\: \fBcaptcha\fR sends it through the CAPTCHA tier
T}
