One message,\: not the whole stream;\: 1024..268435456. It is what grpc\-go defaults its receive limit to,\: so it is the number the backend already lives with
T}
T{
\fBmax_\:messages\fR
T}	T{
int
T}	T{
\fB0\fR (none)
T}	T{
Messages in one request,\: which is how a streaming call is bounded
T}
T{
\fBmax_\:depth\fR
T}	T{
int
T}	T{
\fB16\fR
T}	T{
How deeply messages may nest;\: 1..256
T}
