.SS "routes[].filters"
.PP
A list of filter names, run in the listed order within each stage. A route may combine them with \fBjwt\fR, \fBwaf\fR and \fBicap\fR.
.SS "Kind \fBbody_rewrite\fR"
.PP
Rewrites request and response bodies with literal or regular expression rules, for the cases that need no WebAssembly module: absolute links an application emits for its internal name, a field to mask on the way out, a key to rename on the way in. Each phase is optional and has its own media type list, size bound and rules, applied in order.
.PP
.TS
